# --- Regenerable intermediates --------------------------------------------
# Cached topology objects: rebuilt in seconds by `python run_real.py`.
results/*.pkl
# Scratch arrays from exploratory runs.
*.npy
# Down-scaled JPEGs for the deck: rebuilt by `python build/make_deck.py`.
results/figures/web/

# --- Kept deliberately, do NOT ignore -------------------------------------
# data/aixdhn/*.geojson  real source data (MIT licence, ~2 MB)
# data/dem/*.pkl         cached SRTM rasters: ~8 min and ~360 API calls to
#                        regenerate, so they ship with the repo
# results/figures/*.png  presentation figures
# results/tables/*.json  numerical results
# build/deck.html        the built presentation

